sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Dev as Developer
  participant Ingest as Data Ingestion
  participant CKAN as CKAN API
  participant S3 as S3 Data Lake
  participant EMR as EMR Serverless (Spark)
  participant DDB as DynamoDB
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant API as FastAPI Service
  actor User as Client (Map/UI)
  participant Graf as Grafana Dashboard

  Note right of S3: Buckets: /raw, /ref, /curated, /served
  Note over DDB: Optional — used for quick API responses

  %% --- Ingestion Phase ---
  Dev->>Ingest: Trigger data ingestion job
  Ingest->>CKAN: Fetch datasets (crime, accidents)
  CKAN-->>Ingest: JSON or GeoJSON data
  Ingest->>S3: Store raw data under /raw
  Ingest->>S3: Upload reference files (boroughs, etc.)

  %% --- ETL Phase ---
  Dev->>EMR: Submit Spark job
  EMR->>S3: Read from /raw and /ref
  EMR-->>S3: Write cleaned and normalized data to /curated
  EMR-->>S3: Export results to /served
  EMR-->>DDB: Update area safety scores

  %% --- Serving Phase ---
  User->>GW: GET /areas
  GW->>API: Forward request
  alt Use DynamoDB
      API->>DDB: Query latest scores
      DDB-->>API: Return area scores
  else Use static data
      API->>S3: Read /served/areas.json
      S3-->>API: Return JSON
  end
  API-->>GW: Response (200 OK)
  GW-->>User: Display safety data

  User->>GW: GET /areas/{id}/scores?range=YYYY-MM
  GW->>API: Forward request
  API->>DDB: Query historical scores
  DDB-->>API: Return list of scores
  API-->>User: Send time-series data

  %% --- Visualization Phase ---
  Graf->>S3: Fetch served data (GeoJSON/JSON)
  S3-->>Graf: Return datasets for visualization
